1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:04,040
When we start to look at it: this wealth — what is it?

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:06,040
It is a trial.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:10,720
Wealth — and you love wealth with immense love.

4
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,720
Allah adorned it — right.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,720
So how do you control it? And wealth — some

6
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,680
people get money and they say: so-and-so changed

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,980
with money. Money doesn't change, money doesn't change

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,980
souls — money exposes souls.

9
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,680
It exposes.

10
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,040
It exposes; the rich is rich even

11
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:33,000
and the generous is generous even if he becomes poor,

12
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,120
and the mean is mean even if he gains power.

13
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,520
It only exposes us — money exposes us; dealings

14
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:42,680
with money expose us and strip our masks.
